    "title": "NYC civil service exam: Here are the salaries for positions open in August - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lawrence Ragonese ,\n12 hours ago The New York City civil service exam schedule is open for August, and some jobs pay more than others. The application period for exams opened Aug. 1. Exam applications currently open include: assistant civil engineer; automotive service worker; caseworker; caseworker (NYC H+H); contract specialist; electrician’s helper; electrician’s helper (CUNY); estimator (general construction); plan examiner (buildings); plant maintainer (hospitals)/ tender (NYC H+H); police officer; school safety agent; and traffic enforcement agent. Read full article\n13",
